{
 "steps": [
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "world_ready", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "_comment": "+1 rendered entity (the short_order Q2 SKILL pot, reusing the cauldron sprite) -> sprites 12 -> 13, fallbacks still 0. +1 again (stairs_up door) -> sprites 13 -> 14. pantry_door + rift_vermin_leak -> sprites 14 -> 16. pantry_door_runes -> sprites 16 -> 17. garden_door -> sprites 17 -> 18.", "action": "assert_event_logged", "type": "ui_entities_rendered", "payload_contains": { "sprites": 18, "fallbacks": 0 } },
  { "action": "screenshot", "name": "00_start" },

  { "_comment": "inn_chest container beat, inserted at the very start (before Beat 0) so it round-trips back to the exact spawn cell (2,3) and every existing beat below stays untouched -- inn_chest is at [1,8]; bed [2,7] blocks the straight column-2 path down, so the route jogs left one column early (E4's proven peek route / inventory_loop.json's identical detour): [2,3]->down3->[2,6]->left1->[1,6]->down1->[1,7], face down (blocked by the chest, no move) + interact -> item_gained/toast/ui_toast_rendered (no autosave competes here -- pickup isn't one of the autosave-triggering events, so no toast-queue race like inventory_loop's Relc-gift beat). Then the reverse of the same four moves restores (2,3) exactly before Beat 0 begins.", "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 3 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "left", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "player_cell", "equals": [1, 7] },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "item_gained", "payload_contains": { "item": "leather_jerkin", "source": "inn_chest" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "toast", "payload_contains": { "text": "Got: Leather Jerkin" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_toast_rendered", "payload_contains": { "text": "Got: Leather Jerkin" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "screenshot", "name": "00b_chest_pickup" },
  { "_comment": "This is the FIRST item_gained of the run, so message_layer.gd queues the one-time 'Press I -- your pack.' hint right behind this toast (see message_layer.gd's _first_pickup_hint_pending doc comment). Consume its qualified render here so the since-marker cursor clears it -- every later unqualified ui_toast_rendered wait below (stew_pot/dirty_table/tray/etc.) would otherwise match THIS toast's render instead of its own.", "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_toast_rendered", "payload_contains": { "text": "Press I — your pack." }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "up", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "right", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "up", "steps": 3 },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "player_cell", "equals": [2, 3] },

  { "_comment": "Beat 0 : stew_pot PRE-CLASS -- Helper not yet gained, basic_cooking unknown -> skill_unknown negative + the new locked-prop feedback toast (was previously silent/invisible, the 2/18 blocker). This negative moved here from the post-class-gain slot below because the Helper L1/L3 grant swap (fix 6, onboarding spec sec6) makes basic_cooking available the moment Helper is gained, so the pot is no longer locked after that sleep.", "action": "move", "direction": "right", "steps": 2 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "up", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "skill_unknown", "payload_contains": { "skill": "basic_cooking" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "toast", "payload_contains": { "text": "You don't know your way around a stew pot. Yet." }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_toast_rendered", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "screenshot", "name": "00b_stew_pot_locked_toast" },
  { "action": "assert_event_absent", "type": "accomplishment_recorded", "payload_contains": { "id": "cooked_meal" } },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "player_cell", "equals": [4, 2] },

  { "_comment": "Beat 1: dirty_table clean x2 -> cleaned_the_inn counts 1, 2", "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "right", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "skill_used", "payload_contains": { "skill": "basic_cleaning", "target": "dirty_table" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "accomplishment_recorded", "payload_contains": { "id": "cleaned_the_inn", "count": 1 }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "toast", "payload_contains": { "text": "[Basic Cleaning] — The table is spotless." }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_toast_rendered", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "screenshot", "name": "01_clean_toast" },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "accomplishment_recorded", "payload_contains": { "id": "cleaned_the_inn", "count": 2 }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_toast_rendered", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "accomplishments.cleaned_the_inn", "equals": 2 },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "player_cell", "equals": [5, 3] },

  { "_comment": "Beat 2: serving_tray interact x1 -> delivered_item count 1", "action": "move", "direction": "right", "steps": 5 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "up", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "accomplishment_recorded", "payload_contains": { "id": "delivered_item", "count": 1 }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "toast", "payload_contains": { "text": "You carry the laden tray out to the tables." }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_toast_rendered", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "screenshot", "name": "02_tray_toast" },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "accomplishments.delivered_item", "equals": 1 },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "player_cell", "equals": [10, 3] },

  { "_comment": "Beat 3: hungry_patron, serve x1 -> served_customer count 1. Findings #5/#49 fix (v0.4.2 hotfix): the Serve option is now once_per_waking (was an infinite-gold exploit -- unlimited re-serves, same waking, no gate at all). This beat used to serve TWICE back to back with no sleep between; it now proves the gate itself -- exit, re-talk the SAME waking, and the Serve option is GONE from the visible list (not just un-selectable), leaving only the dismiss line.", "action": "move", "direction": "left", "steps": 4 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 3 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "left", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "dialogue_started", "payload_contains": { "conversation": "patron_serving" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_dialogue_shown", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "screenshot", "name": "03_patron_dialogue" },
  { "action": "press", "name": "confirm" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "accomplishment_recorded", "payload_contains": { "id": "served_customer", "count": 1 }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "confirm" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_dialogue_hidden", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "dialogue_started", "payload_contains": { "conversation": "patron_serving" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "dialogue_node", "payload_contains": { "speaker": "Hungry Patron", "text": "There you are! Stew, bread, anything - I've been sitting here an age.", "options": [ { "text": "\"Someone will be right with you.\"", "locked": false, "requirement": "" } ] }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "confirm" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "dialogue_ended", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "accomplishments.served_customer", "equals": 1 },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "player_cell", "equals": [6, 6] },

  { "_comment": "Beat 4: walk to bed, sleep -> class_gained{helper} (cleaned_the_inn>=1) + exact toast containing Helper", "action": "move", "direction": "up", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "left", "steps": 4 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 2 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "class_gained", "payload_contains": { "class": "helper" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "_comment": "The first-ever autosave toast is a NESTED emission fired from inside Game's class_gained listener, so it lands in the event log BEFORE class_gained itself is recorded here -- assert_event_logged (whole-run scan) rather than wait_for_event (cursor-gated) avoids the ordering trap.", "action": "assert_event_logged", "type": "toast", "payload_contains": { "text": "Autosaved. (Esc — save/load anytime)" } },
  { "_comment": "class_gained toasts now list the class's level-1 grants (spec §4). Helper L1 grants [Basic Cooking] (the §6 stew-pot swap), so the toast reads '[Helper] class gained! — [Basic Cooking]'. Toast matching is exact-equality (test_driver _loosely_equal), so the full O4 text is pinned here.", "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "toast", "payload_contains": { "text": "[Helper] class gained! — [Basic Cooking]" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_toast_rendered", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "screenshot", "name": "04_helper_gained" },
  { "action": "assert_event_absent", "type": "class_level_up", "payload_contains": { "class": "helper" } },

  { "_comment": "Beat 5 : snapshot classes.helper==1; stew_pot right after Helper L1 gain -> NOW USABLE (basic_cooking is the L1 grant post-swap) -> positive skill_used + cooked_meal + toast. The pre-class skill_unknown negative moved to Beat 0 above.", "action": "assert_state", "path": "classes.helper", "equals": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "up", "steps": 3 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "right", "steps": 2 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "up", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "skill_used", "payload_contains": { "skill": "basic_cooking", "target": "stew_pot" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "accomplishment_recorded", "payload_contains": { "id": "cooked_meal", "count": 1 }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "toast", "payload_contains": { "text": "[Basic Cooking] — The stew comes out rich and hot." }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_toast_rendered", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "accomplishments.cooked_meal", "equals": 1 },
  { "action": "assert_state", "path": "player_cell", "equals": [4, 2] },

  { "_comment": "Beat 6: second chore burst -- clean x2 (cleaned_the_inn 3, 4 -- crosses L2 requires_any threshold of 3), serve x1 (served_customer 2, this waking's once_per_waking freshly re-armed by Beat 4's sleep) -> sleep -> class_level_up{helper,2} batched toast (the L2 requires_any is already cleared by cleaned_the_inn alone, so the lower served_customer total doesn't change this gate).", "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "right", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "accomplishment_recorded", "payload_contains": { "id": "cleaned_the_inn", "count": 3 }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_toast_rendered", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "accomplishment_recorded", "payload_contains": { "id": "cleaned_the_inn", "count": 4 }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_toast_rendered", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "right", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 3 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "left", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "interact" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "dialogue_started", "payload_contains": { "conversation": "patron_serving" }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_dialogue_shown", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "confirm" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "accomplishment_recorded", "payload_contains": { "id": "served_customer", "count": 2 }, "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "press", "name": "confirm" },
  { "action": "wait_for_event", "type": "ui_dialogue_hidden", "timeout_sec": 5 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "up", "steps": 1 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "left", "steps": 4 },
  { "action": "move", "direction": "down", "steps": 2 },
